{
    "title": "CRIMEWATCH",
    "description": "CRIMEWATCH opens communication channels between law enforcement agencies and the communities they serve.\r\n\r\nIf your local police department is NOT listed, please let them know about CRIMEWATCH, or email support@crimewatch.net and we will contact them about joining. All crime data comes directly from participating agencies, so if an agency is NOT on CRIMEWATCH, unfortunately no crime data will be available.\r\n\r\nUse this app to browse crime related information from participating agencies. Information such as arrests, fugitives, incidents and other news comes directly from participating local/county/state agencies. Users can anonymously contact participating agencies, or leave contact information. CRIMEWATCH partners with law enforcement and effectively routes intelligence where it needs to go.\r\n\r\nCRIME INFO FROM PARTICIPATING AGENCIES\r\n  \u2022 Dashboards: Displays the top content near your current location, if any\r\n  \u2022 Directory: Find the participating police departments nearest to you\r\n  \u2022 Maps: Browse and drill down into crime information from participating agencies\r\n\r\nSEARCH, FILTER, AND EXPLORE\r\n  \u2022 Arrested: Browse arrested individuals, complete with mugshots, charges, locations and narratives\r\n  \u2022 Wanted: Browse active warrants to see who is 'most wanted' by local law enforcement\r\n  \u2022 Cases: Browse active/cold/closed cases, including narratives and video\r\n\u2022 Incidents: See recent incidents in your area of importance\r\n\r\nGET BREAKING NEWS DIRECTLY FROM THE SOURCE\r\n  \u2022 In the event of an emergency find important information on CRIMEWATCH first\r\n  \u2022 Content on CRIMEWATCH is created directly by our network of law enforcement agencies\r\n  \u2022 Drill down into content that is relevant to you by proximity or agencies you subscribe to\r\n\r\nSTAY INFORMED\r\n  \u2022 Push Notifications \u2013 receive emergency alerts from your local law enforcement agencies directly from the CRIMEWATCH application\r\n  \u2022 Email Notifications \u2013 receive email notifications as crime occurs (real-time and daily/weekly digest options)\r\n\r\nSHARE\r\n  \u2022 Submit tips related to open warrants and cases on CRIMEWATCH\r\n  \u2022 Submit tips related to new or unknown crimes you are aware of\r\n  \u2022 Share content socially on Facebook and Twitter\r\n  \u2022 Share content directly via Email and SMS\r\n\r\nLICENSE AGREEMENT\r\nAll information is provided by participating agencies through the CRIMEWATCH Network.  By downloading this app you agree to the CRIMEWATCH Terms of Use and Privacy Policy, located at https://crimewatch.net\r\n\r\nFor the complete terms and conditions, visit https://crimewatch.net/legal\r\n\r\nFor the privacy policy, visit https://crimewatch.net/privacy\r\n\r\nFor any suggestions and feedback, please email support@crimewatch.net",
    "descriptionHTML": "CRIMEWATCH opens communication channels between law enforcement agencies and the communities they serve.<br><br>If your local police department is NOT listed, please let them know about CRIMEWATCH, or email support@crimewatch.net and we will contact them about joining. All crime data comes directly from participating agencies, so if an agency is NOT on CRIMEWATCH, unfortunately no crime data will be available.<br><br>Use this app to browse crime related information from participating agencies. Information such as arrests, fugitives, incidents and other news comes directly from participating local/county/state agencies. Users can anonymously contact participating agencies, or leave contact information. CRIMEWATCH partners with law enforcement and effectively routes intelligence where it needs to go.<br><br>CRIME INFO FROM PARTICIPATING AGENCIES<br>  \u2022 Dashboards: Displays the top content near your current location, if any<br>  \u2022 Directory: Find the participating police departments nearest to you<br>  \u2022 Maps: Browse and drill down into crime information from participating agencies<br><br>SEARCH, FILTER, AND EXPLORE<br>  \u2022 Arrested: Browse arrested individuals, complete with mugshots, charges, locations and narratives<br>  \u2022 Wanted: Browse active warrants to see who is &#39;most wanted&#39; by local law enforcement<br>  \u2022 Cases: Browse active/cold/closed cases, including narratives and video<br>\u2022 Incidents: See recent incidents in your area of importance<br><br>GET BREAKING NEWS DIRECTLY FROM THE SOURCE<br>  \u2022 In the event of an emergency find important information on CRIMEWATCH first<br>  \u2022 Content on CRIMEWATCH is created directly by our network of law enforcement agencies<br>  \u2022 Drill down into content that is relevant to you by proximity or agencies you subscribe to<br><br>STAY INFORMED<br>  \u2022 Push Notifications \u2013 receive emergency alerts from your local law enforcement agencies directly from the CRIMEWATCH application<br>  \u2022 Email Notifications \u2013 receive email notifications as crime occurs (real-time and daily/weekly digest options)<br><br>SHARE<br>  \u2022 Submit tips related to open warrants and cases on CRIMEWATCH<br>  \u2022 Submit tips related to new or unknown crimes you are aware of<br>  \u2022 Share content socially on Facebook and Twitter<br>  \u2022 Share content directly via Email and SMS<br><br>LICENSE AGREEMENT<br>All information is provided by participating agencies through the CRIMEWATCH Network.  By downloading this app you agree to the CRIMEWATCH Terms of Use and Privacy Policy, located at https://crimewatch.net<br><br>For the complete terms and conditions, visit https://crimewatch.net/legal<br><br>For the privacy policy, visit https://crimewatch.net/privacy<br><br>For any suggestions and feedback, please email support@crimewatch.net",
